                                "sense_id": "1f898a4e-ad93-3375-9995-e02541116936",
                                "text": "But footy, especially this kind of footy, transcended family drama — that went without saying — so Erik Falk had of course invited his son."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3df57e9-15a0-340c-a45f-dfe476049733",
                        "entry_id": "8b59db71-d9e5-3f77-9bb5-9b0d5dfa4e59",
