                                "sense_id": "c3df57e9-15a0-340c-a45f-dfe476049733",
                                "text": "Me and Charlie and Ben were out there one afternoon, messing around, kicking a footy and stuff, and this girl rode by."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8807afb7-a9d7-3a30-9306-009fe7e50984",
